name latex-papersize
category Package
revision 53131
shortdesc Calculate LaTeX settings for any font and paper size
longdesc The package is a Python script, whose typical use is when
longdesc preparing printed material for users with low vision. The most
longdesc effective way of doing this is to print on (notional) small
longdesc paper, and then to magnify the result; the script calculates
longdesc the settings for various font and paper sizes. More details are
longdesc to be read in the script itself.
depend latex-papersize.ARCH
containersize 4696
